# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of which
# platform or editor last touched a file, and regardless of any individual
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, line-ending
# consistency depends entirely on that per-machine git config -- exactly
# what let dod_1260h.json pick up CRLF on a Windows checkout while every
# commit's object content stayed LF underneath it.
* text=auto
